1
00:01:37,057 --> 00:01:38,610
=Ren Yu=

2
00:01:38,611 --> 00:01:42,956
(Adapted from Lei Mi's novel Ren Yu)

3
00:01:42,957 --> 00:01:45,890
=Episode 22=

4
00:01:54,359 --> 00:01:54,799
Hello?

5
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:55,599
(Public Phone)
Captain.

6
00:01:56,239 --> 00:01:57,239
Zhou Xijie fled.

7
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,760
Tell me the second you hear anything.

8
00:02:03,439 --> 00:02:04,120
Okay, okay.

9
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,039
Why are you back?

10
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:13,360
Any news about Na from the police?

11
00:02:13,759 --> 00:02:14,360
No.

12
00:02:15,879 --> 00:02:17,319
The police come by every day.

13
00:02:17,680 --> 00:02:18,479
And the TV

14
00:02:18,639 --> 00:02:20,399
keeps talking about that killer.

15
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:21,479
- I think...
- Stop!

16
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:28,879
I'm sorry, honey.

17
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:31,599
I've tried everything I can.

18
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,680
I'm out of options.

19
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:36,639
Dongchen.

20
00:02:41,199 --> 00:02:41,919
Please.

21
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,919
Please give me my daughter back.

22
00:02:45,800 --> 00:02:47,439
I'm begging you.

23
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:48,520
Dongchen.

24
00:02:57,759 --> 00:02:58,199
No.

25
00:02:59,560 --> 00:03:00,800
I have to turn myself in.

26
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:42,879
Flowers for sale!

27
00:03:45,759 --> 00:03:46,879
Flowers for sale!

28
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:48,912
Flowers!

29
00:03:48,913 --> 00:03:49,758
(Flowers)

30
00:03:49,759 --> 00:03:51,479
Got any bouquets?

31
00:03:52,759 --> 00:03:54,120
Only potted flowers.

32
00:03:54,439 --> 00:03:55,079
Potted is fine.

33
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:56,039
I'll take one.

34
00:03:56,159 --> 00:03:56,879
Coming!

35
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:02,800
Here you are.

36
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:04,120
How much?

37
00:04:04,439 --> 00:04:05,159
One yuan.

38
00:04:10,800 --> 00:04:11,319
Thanks.

39
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:21,800
Looks nice.

40
00:04:30,839 --> 00:04:31,360
Hello?

41
00:04:33,639 --> 00:04:34,120
Hello?

42
00:04:36,279 --> 00:04:36,879
Who is this?

43
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:38,439
Mr. Gu.

44
00:04:39,079 --> 00:04:39,639
It's me.

45
00:04:41,079 --> 00:04:41,600
Su Lin.

46
00:04:43,519 --> 00:04:44,759
Kid, where are you?

47
00:04:48,199 --> 00:04:49,639
Tell me!

48
00:04:55,079 --> 00:04:56,839
Can you hear me?

49
00:05:01,759 --> 00:05:03,758
Can you pick me up at Litong Bridge?

50
00:05:03,759 --> 00:05:04,399
Yes.

51
00:05:04,639 --> 00:05:05,759
I can come get you.

52
00:05:06,879 --> 00:05:08,399
Litong Bridge. I'll be right there.

53
00:05:08,959 --> 00:05:10,279
Wait for me on the bridge.

54
00:05:10,399 --> 00:05:11,399
Don't go anywhere.

55
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:12,680
Wait for me, okay?

56
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:16,479
I'm on my way.

57
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:17,360
Don't move.

58
00:05:29,959 --> 00:05:30,639
There's still time.

59
00:05:56,557 --> 00:06:01,339
(Chaobei Police Bureau)

60
00:06:14,596 --> 00:06:19,130
(Chaobei Police Bureau)

61
00:06:29,120 --> 00:06:31,160
(Call back. News about Ma Na.)

62
00:06:36,190 --> 00:06:39,537
(Chaobei Police Bureau)

63
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:53,800
Is this Ma Dongchen?

64
00:06:53,959 --> 00:06:54,720
Yes.

65
00:06:55,120 --> 00:06:55,839
Who is this?

66
00:06:56,480 --> 00:06:57,519
This is Su Lin.

67
00:06:59,079 --> 00:07:00,000
Where's my daughter?

68
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:02,240
She's with me.

69
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:04,319
Put her on the phone.

70
00:07:05,319 --> 00:07:06,398
Come alone to the intersection of

71
00:07:06,399 --> 00:07:07,920
Zaohua Street and Bei'erma Road.

72
00:07:08,319 --> 00:07:10,000
There's a Xiangren General Store.

73
00:07:10,439 --> 00:07:11,480
Don't call the police.

74
00:07:12,879 --> 00:07:14,040
You have fifteen minutes.

75
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:18,240
Hello?

76
00:07:18,959 --> 00:07:19,480
Hello?

77
00:07:24,120 --> 00:07:25,920
Zaohua Street, Bei'erma Road.

78
00:08:23,879 --> 00:08:24,759
Ma Na.

79
00:08:25,399 --> 00:08:26,759
Mom!

80
00:08:33,759 --> 00:08:34,320
Ma Na!

81
00:08:42,919 --> 00:08:43,559
Ma Na!

82
00:08:43,879 --> 00:08:44,519
Ma Na!

83
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:45,559
Ma Na!

84
00:08:46,000 --> 00:08:46,759
Hang in there.

85
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:48,399
I'll get someone to help.

86
00:08:53,879 --> 00:08:54,879
Come on, Ma Na.

87
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:56,159
Let me prop your head up.

88
00:08:56,919 --> 00:08:57,759
Hang in there.

89
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:00,960
Archive this file.

90
00:09:01,279 --> 00:09:01,799
Okay.

91
00:09:04,759 --> 00:09:05,279
Hello?

92
00:09:05,519 --> 00:09:06,119
(Public Phone)
Tai Wei.

93
00:09:06,120 --> 00:09:06,840
Listen.

94
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:08,919
Su Lin contacted me.

95
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:10,878
She told me to meet at Litong Bridge.

96
00:09:10,879 --> 00:09:12,639
But under the bridge,

97
00:09:12,759 --> 00:09:14,320
I found her classmate,

98
00:09:14,600 --> 00:09:15,320
Ma Na.

99
00:09:16,799 --> 00:09:17,720
Got it, Mr. Gu.

100
00:09:17,879 --> 00:09:18,678
Stay with Ma Na.

101
00:09:18,679 --> 00:09:19,720
I'm sending people now.

102
00:09:20,039 --> 00:09:21,320
Okay.

103
00:09:23,536 --> 00:09:26,704
(File Envelope)

104
00:09:32,480 --> 00:09:35,453
(Court Summons: Hearing)

105
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:39,519
Mom.

106
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:41,320
I'm ready.

107
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:44,559
All set?

108
00:09:48,799 --> 00:09:49,519
That's probably Ms. Tao.

109
00:09:53,279 --> 00:09:54,080
Ms. Tao.

110
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:56,840
Ting.

111
00:09:57,080 --> 00:09:58,039
Ready?

112
00:09:58,720 --> 00:09:59,679
We've been ready.

113
00:10:00,279 --> 00:10:01,039
Here.

114
00:10:01,903 --> 00:10:02,758
(File Envelope)

115
00:10:02,759 --> 00:10:03,399
Don't worry.

116
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:06,200
Do your best in court today.

117
00:10:11,399 --> 00:10:12,159
Wait a second.

118
00:10:16,080 --> 00:10:16,600
Hello?

119
00:10:16,879 --> 00:10:17,479
Jiang?

120
00:10:17,480 --> 00:10:18,120
You're home?

121
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:18,919
Good.

122
00:10:19,279 --> 00:10:20,279
Jiang, remember

123
00:10:20,399 --> 00:10:21,878
that sewer tunnel we went into?

124
00:10:21,879 --> 00:10:23,239
The place Su Lin was staying?

125
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:23,919
You remember?

126
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:25,119
Of course, Mr. Gu.

127
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:25,759
What's wrong?

128
00:10:25,879 --> 00:10:27,200
Go there right now.

129
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:28,918
If you run into Su Lin,

130
00:10:28,919 --> 00:10:30,919
don't let her do anything.

131
00:10:31,200 --> 00:10:32,758
Sorry, I don't quite understand.

132
00:10:32,759 --> 00:10:33,720
What do you mean?

133
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:35,158
Jiang, I can't explain it

134
00:10:35,159 --> 00:10:36,240
all over the phone.

135
00:10:36,399 --> 00:10:38,000
You're the closest one there.

136
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:40,119
Please get over there right now.

137
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:41,919
The police and I are on our way.

138
00:10:42,039 --> 00:10:42,999
If you see anyone else,

139
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:45,320
tell them to wait for the police.

140
00:10:46,480 --> 00:10:47,279
Mr. Gu.

141
00:10:48,600 --> 00:10:49,320
I'm sorry.

142
00:10:51,480 --> 00:10:53,519
My ex-husband is suing me.

143
00:10:54,759 --> 00:10:56,080
I have to be in court now.

144
00:10:57,639 --> 00:10:58,200
I see.

145
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:00,960
Then...

146
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:02,519
Then take care of that first.

147
00:11:02,679 --> 00:11:03,600
I'll find another way.

148
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:04,840
I'll find a way.

149
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:06,519
I'm really sorry.

150
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:07,679
But...

151
00:11:11,399 --> 00:11:11,999
Mom.

152
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:12,639
What happened?

153
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:15,600
Yushu.

154
00:11:17,039 --> 00:11:17,919
Is everything okay?

155
00:11:19,720 --> 00:11:20,639
Yes. It's okay.

156
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:22,320
It's okay.

157
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:25,080
Let's go.

158
00:11:25,720 --> 00:11:26,798
I'm fine. Let's go.

159
00:11:26,799 --> 00:11:27,638
Come on, let's go.

160
00:11:27,639 --> 00:11:28,279
Go.

161
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:29,518
My shoes.

162
00:11:29,519 --> 00:11:29,960
Let's go.

163
00:11:30,279 --> 00:11:31,200
Got your keys?

164
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:32,679
Yeah.

165
00:12:30,399 --> 00:12:31,159
Get in.

166
00:12:46,879 --> 00:12:47,559
Tao.

167
00:12:49,960 --> 00:12:51,080
I'm not going.

168
00:12:52,159 --> 00:12:52,799
What?

169
00:12:53,399 --> 00:12:54,600
Mom, why not?

170
00:12:57,840 --> 00:12:58,600
What did you say?

171
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:00,200
Why aren't you going?

172
00:13:00,519 --> 00:13:01,960
Something urgent came up.

173
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:02,960
It's an emergency.

174
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:05,320
I have to handle it.

175
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:07,799
Right now,

176
00:13:07,960 --> 00:13:10,240
what matters more than this case?

177
00:13:11,399 --> 00:13:12,159
I know.

178
00:13:12,559 --> 00:13:13,240
Yushu.

179
00:13:14,279 --> 00:13:15,600
If you don't show up,

180
00:13:16,600 --> 00:13:17,919
you know what could happen.

181
00:13:18,559 --> 00:13:20,360
I don't know how to explain this.

182
00:13:20,720 --> 00:13:22,440
What happened, Mom?

183
00:13:28,960 --> 00:13:29,879
Listen.

184
00:13:33,559 --> 00:13:34,440
Mr. Gu

185
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:36,600
and Su Lin

186
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:38,120
need me.

187
00:13:38,759 --> 00:13:39,879
I have to help them.

188
00:13:41,279 --> 00:13:42,320
In court,

189
00:13:43,519 --> 00:13:45,039
listen to Ms. Tao.

190
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:48,799
Think carefully about what you want.

191
00:13:51,320 --> 00:13:53,000
You have to say

192
00:13:53,159 --> 00:13:53,639
what you

193
00:13:54,080 --> 00:13:55,200
truly want to say,

194
00:13:55,720 --> 00:13:56,919
and what you need to say.

195
00:14:01,159 --> 00:14:02,000
Don't worry, Mom.

196
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:06,279
You'll always be my daughter.

197
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:08,240
Of course.

198
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:17,399
Go.

199
00:14:19,720 --> 00:14:20,240
Go.

200
00:14:24,399 --> 00:14:25,080
Go on.

201
00:14:33,360 --> 00:14:34,000
Please.

202
00:14:42,559 --> 00:14:43,279
You got this.

203
00:14:57,840 --> 00:14:59,399
(Call back.)

204
00:15:16,279 --> 00:15:17,279
Where's my daughter?

205
00:15:18,519 --> 00:15:20,080
There's a manhole by the road.

206
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:21,759
Take a flashlight and go down.

207
00:15:21,960 --> 00:15:23,159
Then follow the arrows.

208
00:15:23,600 --> 00:15:25,440
What arrows? Where's my daughter?

209
00:15:26,039 --> 00:15:26,879
Ten minutes.

210
00:15:27,519 --> 00:15:28,480
When time's up,

211
00:15:28,600 --> 00:15:29,719
I'll kill her.

212
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:31,960
If you touch my daughter,

213
00:15:32,360 --> 00:15:34,079
I'll kill your whole family!

214
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:35,799
I'll skin your brother alive.

215
00:15:39,159 --> 00:15:40,159
Su Lin!

216
00:15:40,600 --> 00:15:42,559
No one hangs up on me!

217
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:00,720
Na!

218
00:16:03,240 --> 00:16:03,839
Dad!

219
00:16:03,840 --> 00:16:05,240
Daddy's here.

220
00:16:51,679 --> 00:16:52,879
Anyone there?

221
00:17:17,079 --> 00:17:18,279
Na!

222
00:17:19,279 --> 00:17:21,400
Don't be scared.

223
00:17:21,680 --> 00:17:23,680
Dad's here!

224
00:17:32,519 --> 00:17:33,400
Eight minutes.

225
00:17:33,839 --> 00:17:34,680
Eight minutes...

226
00:17:35,200 --> 00:17:36,000
Na!

227
00:17:45,319 --> 00:17:46,079
Na!

228
00:17:46,440 --> 00:17:47,599
Na!

229
00:17:56,920 --> 00:17:57,799
Who's there?

230
00:17:59,680 --> 00:18:00,240
Who is it?

231
00:18:00,480 --> 00:18:01,279
Who's there?

232
00:18:01,440 --> 00:18:02,119
Who are you?

233
00:18:06,160 --> 00:18:06,920
Who are you?

234
00:18:07,559 --> 00:18:08,599
I'm looking for someone.

235
00:18:08,880 --> 00:18:09,720
Who?

236
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:11,759
I heard you calling Ma Na.

237
00:18:12,200 --> 00:18:12,879
Yes.

238
00:18:12,880 --> 00:18:14,039
I'm Ma Na's father.

239
00:18:14,160 --> 00:18:15,118
She's in there.

240
00:18:15,119 --> 00:18:16,279
I have to save her.

241
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:21,399
You're Ma Na's father?

242
00:18:21,400 --> 00:18:21,960
Yes.

243
00:18:22,079 --> 00:18:22,839
Who are you?

244
00:18:24,559 --> 00:18:25,559
You can't go in.

245
00:18:25,839 --> 00:18:26,839
- Why?
- Not today.

246
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:27,999
You can't go in.

247
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:28,558
Why?

248
00:18:28,559 --> 00:18:29,399
You just can't.

249
00:18:29,400 --> 00:18:31,159
My daughter's dying in there!

250
00:18:31,160 --> 00:18:32,919
Whatever happens, you can't go in.

251
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:34,399
Who the hell are you?

252
00:18:34,400 --> 00:18:35,118
No!

253
00:18:35,119 --> 00:18:36,839
Move!

254
00:18:40,319 --> 00:18:41,479
You really can't go in.

255
00:18:41,480 --> 00:18:42,278
Listen to me.

256
00:18:42,279 --> 00:18:43,480
They're almost here.

257
00:18:43,640 --> 00:18:44,719
Wait five minutes.

258
00:18:44,720 --> 00:18:45,558
Get out of my way!

259
00:18:45,559 --> 00:18:47,598
Five minutes. You can't go in.

260
00:18:47,599 --> 00:18:48,959
You can't go in!

261
00:18:48,960 --> 00:18:49,799
Go away!

262
00:18:50,279 --> 00:18:52,479
My daughter's dying!

263
00:18:52,480 --> 00:18:54,078
Don't do anything stupid!

264
00:18:54,079 --> 00:18:55,558
Stop turning it!

265
00:18:55,559 --> 00:18:56,680
Don't go in!

266
00:18:56,799 --> 00:18:58,759
Get out of my way!

267
00:19:01,599 --> 00:19:02,319
Na!

268
00:19:03,720 --> 00:19:04,599
Daddy's here!

269
00:19:08,400 --> 00:19:09,599
Don't go in!

270
00:19:17,599 --> 00:19:18,519
Don't go in!

271
00:19:21,880 --> 00:19:24,160
Daddy's here!

272
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:34,439
Go in!

273
00:19:34,440 --> 00:19:35,119
Let go of me!

274
00:19:36,519 --> 00:19:38,200
Please! Don't come any closer!

275
00:19:38,799 --> 00:19:40,240
(Xiaolan.)

276
00:21:05,702 --> 00:21:11,216
(Police Line)

277
00:21:30,720 --> 00:21:31,119
Tingting.

278
00:21:31,319 --> 00:21:31,799
Come on.

279
00:21:32,279 --> 00:21:33,480
Have someone take them home.

280
00:21:34,920 --> 00:21:35,239
Help her up.

281
00:21:35,240 --> 00:21:35,799
Give her a hand.

282
00:21:36,720 --> 00:21:36,960
Come.

283
00:21:37,200 --> 00:21:37,839
This way.

284
00:21:44,920 --> 00:21:45,559
Easy.

285
00:21:45,841 --> 00:21:47,575
(Police)

286
00:22:00,680 --> 00:22:01,440
Ma Na's okay.

287
00:23:36,920 --> 00:23:38,000
Mom, you're back.

288
00:23:38,599 --> 00:23:39,559
How are they?

289
00:23:42,599 --> 00:23:43,720
What happened to you?

290
00:23:45,319 --> 00:23:46,119
What happened?

291
00:23:48,720 --> 00:23:49,640
It's all taken care of.

292
00:23:51,240 --> 00:23:52,279
Everything's settled.

293
00:23:53,279 --> 00:23:54,119
Settled?

294
00:23:56,759 --> 00:23:57,359
Really?

295
00:23:59,839 --> 00:24:00,919
You scared me to death.

296
00:24:00,920 --> 00:24:02,240
I thought something happened.

297
00:24:04,359 --> 00:24:05,720
It's really all over?

298
00:24:06,119 --> 00:24:07,599
I'm covered in mud.

299
00:24:07,799 --> 00:24:09,240
Don't get yourself dirty.

300
00:24:10,000 --> 00:24:10,639
I'm filthy.

301
00:24:10,640 --> 00:24:11,720
I'll get you a towel.

302
00:24:26,160 --> 00:24:27,400
How did you get like this?

303
00:24:28,799 --> 00:24:29,118
Look at you.

304
00:24:29,119 --> 00:24:29,798
I'll do it.

305
00:24:29,799 --> 00:24:30,598
Here, let me.

306
00:24:30,599 --> 00:24:31,078
It's okay.

307
00:24:31,079 --> 00:24:31,598
I got it.

308
00:24:31,599 --> 00:24:32,239
Stay back.

309
00:24:32,240 --> 00:24:33,240
Let me.

310
00:24:42,160 --> 00:24:43,599
Mom, why don't you change?

311
00:24:46,519 --> 00:24:47,159
Come on.

312
00:24:47,160 --> 00:24:48,200
Go change your clothes.

313
00:24:48,319 --> 00:24:49,039
Go on.

314
00:24:51,839 --> 00:24:52,440
Oh, right.

315
00:24:53,680 --> 00:24:55,119
Mom, you haven't eaten, have you?

316
00:24:55,759 --> 00:24:56,640
Go change.

317
00:24:56,759 --> 00:24:57,640
I'll make noodles.

318
00:25:21,160 --> 00:25:21,920
Ting.

319
00:25:27,680 --> 00:25:28,680
The hearing's over.

320
00:25:28,839 --> 00:25:30,039
Dad was furious.

321
00:25:32,799 --> 00:25:33,960
It was pretty simple.

322
00:25:35,079 --> 00:25:36,199
The judge just asked me

323
00:25:36,200 --> 00:25:37,759
who I wanted to live with.

324
00:25:38,240 --> 00:25:39,119
Obviously.

325
00:25:40,880 --> 00:25:41,960
So what did you say?

326
00:25:42,400 --> 00:25:43,680
You, of course.

327
00:25:52,680 --> 00:25:54,000
What did the judge say?

328
00:25:54,920 --> 00:25:56,119
The judge...

329
00:25:56,839 --> 00:25:58,079
The judge just smiled,

330
00:25:59,279 --> 00:26:00,480
then let me go home.

331
00:26:05,799 --> 00:26:06,759
That simple?

332
00:26:09,480 --> 00:26:10,119
Mom.

333
00:26:10,480 --> 00:26:11,680
You

334
00:26:12,079 --> 00:26:13,519
always worry too much.

335
00:26:13,640 --> 00:26:15,319
Didn't Ms. Tao tell you?

336
00:26:15,680 --> 00:26:17,359
What I want matters most.

337
00:26:19,960 --> 00:26:22,319
You're the best,

338
00:26:22,720 --> 00:26:24,759
bravest, kindest mom in the world.

339
00:26:24,880 --> 00:26:26,279
Who else would I choose?

340
00:26:30,200 --> 00:26:31,039
Oh, Mom.

341
00:26:32,319 --> 00:26:33,599
Dad says he's going to appeal.

342
00:26:34,279 --> 00:26:35,079
But it's okay.

343
00:26:35,640 --> 00:26:36,720
Let him appeal.

344
00:26:37,279 --> 00:26:38,200
No matter what,

345
00:26:39,200 --> 00:26:40,880
I'll always stay with you.

346
00:26:43,920 --> 00:26:45,640
You're the best mom in the world.

347
00:26:46,720 --> 00:26:48,519
I never want us to be apart.

348
00:27:02,880 --> 00:27:03,799
What's wrong, Mom?

349
00:27:05,799 --> 00:27:06,640
What is it?

350
00:27:12,240 --> 00:27:12,920
You...

351
00:27:15,160 --> 00:27:16,519
I'm not leaving you.

352
00:27:51,846 --> 00:27:54,019
(Beloved Father Tai Zhiliang)

353
00:28:13,015 --> 00:28:16,028
(Tai Zhiliang's Grave)

354
00:28:24,743 --> 00:28:27,563
(Tai Zhiliang's Grave)

355
00:30:38,079 --> 00:30:38,811
Tell them

356
00:30:38,812 --> 00:30:39,572
(Evidence)
don't disturb it.

357
00:30:43,680 --> 00:30:44,558
Get it to the bureau.

358
00:30:44,559 --> 00:30:45,559
Lots of traces here.

359
00:30:45,720 --> 00:30:46,720
I'll log these first.

360
00:31:40,440 --> 00:31:41,480
Feel sorry for him?

361
00:31:43,279 --> 00:31:44,519
Why should I?

362
00:31:47,400 --> 00:31:48,319
Who pities me?

363
00:31:56,200 --> 00:31:57,319
At least he had me.

364
00:31:58,799 --> 00:31:59,759
I gave him his medicine.

365
00:32:01,880 --> 00:32:02,640
I satisfied him.

366
00:32:05,839 --> 00:32:06,720
I even gave him money.

367
00:32:12,319 --> 00:32:13,000
But how about me?

368
00:32:16,359 --> 00:32:18,160
I'm the one who has nothing.

369
00:32:24,960 --> 00:32:25,640
But

370
00:32:29,920 --> 00:32:31,599
we do have one thing in common.

371
00:32:38,440 --> 00:32:40,000
Neither of us has a soul.

372
00:32:42,359 --> 00:32:43,440
Who would've thought

373
00:32:44,759 --> 00:32:45,720
what he couldn't stand

374
00:32:47,119 --> 00:32:48,319
was his own wife

375
00:32:48,480 --> 00:32:50,640
mocking the few poems he'd written?

376
00:32:55,519 --> 00:32:56,440
On the surface,

377
00:32:56,759 --> 00:32:58,358
that was what kept

378
00:32:58,359 --> 00:33:00,039
building up his resentment.

379
00:33:01,079 --> 00:33:02,079
But at the root of it

380
00:33:02,480 --> 00:33:05,039
was his insecurity and sensitivity.

381
00:33:05,559 --> 00:33:07,160
He misread how others saw him,

382
00:33:08,240 --> 00:33:10,119
triggering everything that followed.

383
00:33:16,720 --> 00:33:18,000
(Interrogation, Meeting)
Qiao said

384
00:33:18,839 --> 00:33:20,519
Zhou Xijie's sexual dysfunction

385
00:33:21,079 --> 00:33:22,480
came from his family.

386
00:33:23,039 --> 00:33:24,839
He'd been ignored for years.

387
00:33:26,039 --> 00:33:27,920
Only total control

388
00:33:28,279 --> 00:33:29,720
could satisfy him sexually.

389
00:33:30,160 --> 00:33:31,680
Controlling the drifter

390
00:33:32,920 --> 00:33:34,039
came from the same need.

391
00:33:34,839 --> 00:33:36,680
So our earlier profile

392
00:33:36,839 --> 00:33:37,640
was right.

393
00:33:41,079 --> 00:33:41,640
Captain.

394
00:33:42,559 --> 00:33:44,319
This case really put us

395
00:33:44,480 --> 00:33:45,400
on the map.

396
00:33:48,720 --> 00:33:50,440
So from now on,

397
00:33:51,440 --> 00:33:53,240
when we're out on a case,

398
00:33:54,119 --> 00:33:54,839
I'm paying.

399
00:33:56,680 --> 00:33:57,759
Keep your money

400
00:33:58,240 --> 00:33:59,039
for yourself.

401
00:34:12,741 --> 00:34:16,221
(Chaobei Police Bureau Notice
Wang Xianjiang: Job Reassignment)

402
00:34:43,440 --> 00:34:45,679
Don't be so reckless next time.

403
00:34:46,960 --> 00:34:47,679
I'm off.

404
00:35:09,920 --> 00:35:10,519
Gu.

405
00:35:11,000 --> 00:35:12,599
We found this on Ma Na.

406
00:35:12,719 --> 00:35:13,599
Su Lin's diary.

407
00:35:14,119 --> 00:35:15,440
I think you should read it.

408
00:35:20,559 --> 00:35:22,360
(May 1994)
(A strange entry.)

409
00:35:23,119 --> 00:35:24,960
(I don't know why I'm writing this.)

410
00:35:26,119 --> 00:35:26,679
(But)

411
00:35:27,079 --> 00:35:29,199
(if someone reads my diary someday,)

412
00:35:29,679 --> 00:35:32,599
(they'll know what happened to me.)

413
00:35:33,920 --> 00:35:34,919
(As for me by then,)

414
00:35:34,920 --> 00:35:35,840
(alive or dead)

415
00:35:36,719 --> 00:35:37,800
(won't matter anymore.)

416
00:35:39,159 --> 00:35:39,880
(6/24/1994)
(Mr. Gu,)

417
00:35:40,360 --> 00:35:41,039
(hello.)

418
00:35:42,239 --> 00:35:43,199
(You read that right.)

419
00:35:43,840 --> 00:35:45,000
(This entry)

420
00:35:45,239 --> 00:35:46,400
(is written for you.)

421
00:35:47,639 --> 00:35:49,199
(By the time you read this,)

422
00:35:49,519 --> 00:35:50,239
(I believe)

423
00:35:50,719 --> 00:35:51,678
(you'll already know)

424
00:35:51,679 --> 00:35:53,199
(the whole story.)

425
00:35:55,400 --> 00:35:56,960
(If I've guessed right,)

426
00:35:57,880 --> 00:36:00,320
(Ma Na should be home by now.)

427
00:36:07,360 --> 00:36:08,480
(As for Zhou Xijie,)

428
00:36:09,280 --> 00:36:11,199
(the police should have him by now.)

429
00:36:13,880 --> 00:36:15,079
(I can imagine)

430
00:36:15,679 --> 00:36:17,480
(the look on your face.)

431
00:36:18,599 --> 00:36:19,400
(I'm sorry.)

432
00:36:20,119 --> 00:36:21,159
(I let you down.)

433
00:36:22,119 --> 00:36:23,639
(That day in the sewer,)

434
00:36:24,559 --> 00:36:26,360
(I knew you meant every word.)

435
00:36:27,679 --> 00:36:28,679
(And I knew)

436
00:36:29,360 --> 00:36:30,960
(if I'd gone back with you,)

437
00:36:31,679 --> 00:36:32,518
(you'd treat me)

438
00:36:32,519 --> 00:36:34,199
(like your own daughter,)

439
00:36:35,440 --> 00:36:36,719
(and let me be)

440
00:36:37,519 --> 00:36:39,840
(an ordinary, happy girl.)

441
00:36:41,280 --> 00:36:42,079
(You know what?)

442
00:36:43,559 --> 00:36:45,320
(I wanted that life more than anything.)

443
00:37:04,880 --> 00:37:05,559
(So)

444
00:37:06,639 --> 00:37:07,599
(please believe me.)

445
00:37:09,599 --> 00:37:10,678
(Making this choice)

446
00:37:10,679 --> 00:37:11,719
(hurt me too.)

447
00:37:13,000 --> 00:37:14,079
(But I don't regret it.)

448
00:37:19,519 --> 00:37:20,718
(I gave up)

449
00:37:20,719 --> 00:37:22,519
(my chance at a normal life)

450
00:37:23,639 --> 00:37:25,920
(because of the man you call a killer.)

451
00:37:27,440 --> 00:37:28,559
(His name is Vincent.)

452
00:37:30,920 --> 00:37:31,599
(I think)

453
00:37:32,360 --> 00:37:33,679
(he deserves a name,)

454
00:37:34,320 --> 00:37:35,518
(not just "the killer.")

455
00:37:35,519 --> 00:37:36,558
You know,

456
00:37:36,559 --> 00:37:37,840
there's an American TV show

457
00:37:38,079 --> 00:37:39,400
called Beauty and the Beast.

458
00:37:39,599 --> 00:37:40,638
The beast's name

459
00:37:40,639 --> 00:37:41,679
is Vincent.

460
00:37:42,480 --> 00:37:43,639
Vin...

461
00:37:46,559 --> 00:37:47,440
Vin...

462
00:37:47,880 --> 00:37:48,719
cen...

463
00:37:49,000 --> 00:37:49,599
t.

464
00:37:49,960 --> 00:37:50,880
Vincent.

465
00:37:51,920 --> 00:37:52,960
Vin...

466
00:37:55,239 --> 00:37:56,119
cen...

467
00:37:58,920 --> 00:37:59,719
- t.
- t.

468
00:38:01,159 --> 00:38:02,879
(While I was trapped)

469
00:38:02,880 --> 00:38:03,920
(in that sewer,)

470
00:38:04,599 --> 00:38:05,920
(if it weren't for Vincent,)

471
00:38:06,320 --> 00:38:07,400
(I'd have died long ago.)

472
00:38:09,039 --> 00:38:10,639
(He treated my wounds,)

473
00:38:11,079 --> 00:38:12,320
(and gave me food and water.)

474
00:38:14,079 --> 00:38:15,119
(When my life)

475
00:38:15,599 --> 00:38:17,320
(was about to disappear completely,)

476
00:38:18,159 --> 00:38:19,320
(he kept me going)

477
00:38:20,119 --> 00:38:21,239
(and kept me alive.)

478
00:38:22,440 --> 00:38:24,800
(Even if the whole world called him
a murderous monster,)

479
00:38:25,480 --> 00:38:27,039
(he was the only one)

480
00:38:27,320 --> 00:38:28,840
(who ever gave me warmth then.)

481
00:38:30,079 --> 00:38:32,239
(He saved my life.)

482
00:38:33,840 --> 00:38:34,840
(Besides,)

483
00:38:35,199 --> 00:38:37,480
(Vincent did those terrible things)

484
00:38:37,800 --> 00:38:39,480
(under Zhou Xijie's control.)

485
00:38:41,920 --> 00:38:42,639
(So)

486
00:38:43,400 --> 00:38:45,760
(when I saw Zhou Xijie kill him,)

487
00:38:46,440 --> 00:38:48,079
(I couldn't just walk away.)

488
00:38:50,039 --> 00:38:52,440
(I had to do something.)

489
00:38:53,559 --> 00:38:54,719
(And I'll do everything I can)

490
00:38:55,519 --> 00:38:56,880
(to make everyone see the truth.)

491
00:38:58,052 --> 00:38:58,919
(Long-Distance Calls)

492
00:38:58,920 --> 00:38:59,959
(I had no proof)

493
00:38:59,960 --> 00:39:01,400
(that Zhou Xijie knew Vincent)

494
00:39:01,679 --> 00:39:02,679
(or meant to kill him.)

495
00:39:02,799 --> 00:39:03,638
(Chaobei Culture Center)

496
00:39:03,639 --> 00:39:04,519
(Director's Office)
(I feared)

497
00:39:04,920 --> 00:39:06,800
(a story told by a kid)

498
00:39:07,320 --> 00:39:08,440
(wouldn't be believed.)

499
00:39:09,360 --> 00:39:11,199
(So I chose this way)

500
00:39:11,679 --> 00:39:13,440
(to make Zhou Xijie expose himself)

501
00:39:13,840 --> 00:39:14,679
(and get proof.)

502
00:39:17,039 --> 00:39:17,559
(Then,)

503
00:39:18,159 --> 00:39:19,800
(I carefully measured the wire)

504
00:39:20,199 --> 00:39:21,039
(and trapped him,)

505
00:39:21,480 --> 00:39:23,119
(helping the police arrest him.)

506
00:39:26,072 --> 00:39:27,359
(Chaobei Vocational High
Discipline Notice)

507
00:39:27,360 --> 00:39:28,131
(Meanwhile,)

508
00:39:28,132 --> 00:39:29,158
(Ma Na, Zhao Lingling, and Song Shuang)

509
00:39:29,159 --> 00:39:30,585
(repeatedly fought with)
(I had my own reasons.)

510
00:39:30,586 --> 00:39:32,145
(and bullied classmates,
seriously violating rules.)

511
00:39:32,146 --> 00:39:34,228
(They've been expelled and referred)
(I wanted those who hurt me)

512
00:39:34,229 --> 00:39:34,839
(to the police.)

513
00:39:34,840 --> 00:39:36,239
(to face some consequences too.)

514
00:39:43,599 --> 00:39:44,119
(Mr. Gu,)

515
00:39:45,000 --> 00:39:46,159
(I'm truly sorry)

516
00:39:46,559 --> 00:39:47,679
(for making this choice.)

517
00:39:48,400 --> 00:39:49,198
(But I never)

518
00:39:49,199 --> 00:39:50,760
(wanted to hurt anyone.)

519
00:39:52,320 --> 00:39:53,920
(Thank you for everything you did.)

520
00:39:54,719 --> 00:39:56,319
(Thank you for spending so much)

521
00:39:56,320 --> 00:39:57,559
(and time looking for me.)

522
00:39:59,039 --> 00:39:59,920
(Thank you)

523
00:40:00,440 --> 00:40:01,518
(for never treating me)

524
00:40:01,519 --> 00:40:02,800
(like I didn't matter.)

525
00:40:05,800 --> 00:40:06,559
(Finally,)

526
00:40:07,119 --> 00:40:08,679
(I have one more favor to ask.)

527
00:40:10,079 --> 00:40:12,079
(Please thank the girl and her mom)

528
00:40:12,280 --> 00:40:14,480
(you mentioned in the sewer.)

529
00:40:15,960 --> 00:40:17,760
(Thank the girl who helped me)

530
00:40:17,960 --> 00:40:19,480
(escape from the auditorium,)

531
00:40:20,719 --> 00:40:23,320
(and the boy you said kept looking.)

532
00:40:24,079 --> 00:40:26,159
(We barely knew each other,)

533
00:40:26,519 --> 00:40:27,920
(but they gave me courage)

534
00:40:28,360 --> 00:40:29,960
(and lit the road ahead.)

535
00:40:32,039 --> 00:40:32,719
(Mr. Gu,)

536
00:40:33,679 --> 00:40:35,119
(you all showed me)

537
00:40:35,639 --> 00:40:36,920
(that in this world,)

538
00:40:37,320 --> 00:40:38,760
(I was never truly alone.)

539
00:40:39,800 --> 00:40:40,519
(I learned)

540
00:40:41,400 --> 00:40:42,559
(that I was loved too.)

541
00:40:45,559 --> 00:40:47,239
(The supreme happiness of life)

542
00:40:47,559 --> 00:40:49,760
(is the conviction that we are loved.)

543
00:40:50,920 --> 00:40:52,360
(Without that certainty,)

544
00:40:52,960 --> 00:40:54,719
(I might've stayed trapped forever.)

545
00:40:58,320 --> 00:40:59,800
(I used to wonder endlessly)

546
00:41:00,480 --> 00:41:02,039
(what a home should be.)

547
00:41:03,159 --> 00:41:03,960
(My family...)

548
00:41:04,760 --> 00:41:05,840
(Did they care about me?)

549
00:41:08,079 --> 00:41:09,079
(I never knew.)

550
00:41:12,159 --> 00:41:13,480
(Now,)

551
00:41:13,920 --> 00:41:15,280
(that's all behind me.)

552
00:41:16,400 --> 00:41:18,320
(But I won't forget those days.)

553
00:41:20,236 --> 00:41:25,023
(Sister)

554
00:41:28,039 --> 00:41:29,840
(No matter how hard it is to leave,)

555
00:41:31,280 --> 00:41:33,320
(Gu Lan, Chaobei to Shanhai)
(I have to leave my past behind.)

556
00:41:34,960 --> 00:41:36,518
(Passengers traveling to Shanhai)

557
00:41:36,519 --> 00:41:38,719
(on Train 275,)

558
00:41:39,000 --> 00:41:41,400
(please enter through Waiting Room 1)

559
00:41:41,559 --> 00:41:42,800
(and board at Platform 4.)

560
00:41:46,159 --> 00:41:47,000
(Mr. Gu,)

561
00:41:47,880 --> 00:41:49,719
(by the time you finish this diary,)

562
00:41:50,079 --> 00:41:52,159
(Entrance)
(I may already be somewhere else.)

563
00:41:52,960 --> 00:41:54,039
(This city)

564
00:41:54,679 --> 00:41:56,639
(held all the pain of my youth,)

565
00:41:57,440 --> 00:41:59,159
(and all the scars of leaving.)

566
00:42:00,840 --> 00:42:01,599
(Now,)

567
00:42:02,000 --> 00:42:03,199
(I'll leave the past behind)

568
00:42:03,880 --> 00:42:04,920
(and face the future.)

569
00:42:06,159 --> 00:42:07,719
(Please don't look for me anymore.)

570
00:42:09,000 --> 00:42:10,480
(We may meet again.)

571
00:42:11,039 --> 00:42:12,125
(Or we may not.)

572
00:42:12,126 --> 00:42:13,799
(Keep going. Don't stop.)

573
00:42:13,800 --> 00:42:15,000
(But I promise you,)

574
00:42:16,119 --> 00:42:18,880
(I'll live a good life.)

575
00:42:20,559 --> 00:42:22,559
Zhou Xijie was convicted.

576
00:42:23,039 --> 00:42:23,880
He was behind it.

577
00:42:24,320 --> 00:42:26,239
The drifter was being used.

578
00:42:26,840 --> 00:42:27,559
Su Lin

579
00:42:28,440 --> 00:42:29,719
helped that drifter,

580
00:42:30,800 --> 00:42:31,559
Vincent,

581
00:42:32,400 --> 00:42:33,440
get the truth back.

582
00:42:37,159 --> 00:42:37,960
Su Lin...

583
00:42:38,440 --> 00:42:39,199
Any news?

584
00:42:48,440 --> 00:42:49,480
Where could she have gone?

585
00:42:51,280 --> 00:42:51,920
She...

586
00:43:07,800 --> 00:43:08,480
I think

587
00:43:11,639 --> 00:43:13,039
she swam out to sea.

588
00:43:13,953 --> 00:43:19,885
♪ Do you remember ♪

589
00:43:19,886 --> 00:43:26,080
♪ Who was in your heart?♪

590
00:43:28,625 --> 00:43:33,156
(Su Lin's Diary)
(What's the best Little Mermaid ending?)

591
00:43:39,671 --> 00:43:41,670
(Zhou Xijie used the drifter to rape
several women and was guilty of rape.)

592
00:43:41,671 --> 00:43:43,670
(He murdered several women and
deliberately ran one victim down.)

593
00:43:43,671 --> 00:43:45,670
(He's sentenced to death and stripped of
political rights for life.)

594
00:43:45,671 --> 00:43:47,670
(Ma Dongchen faked a death certificate
and left another injured.)

595
00:43:47,671 --> 00:43:49,413
(He also tried to take
another person's life, but failed.)

596
00:43:49,414 --> 00:43:51,455
(He forged official seals and committed
assault and attempted murder.)

597
00:43:51,456 --> 00:43:53,497
(He's sentenced to life and
stripped of political rights for life.)

598
00:43:53,498 --> 00:43:55,539
(Principal Dong neglected duties,
took bribes and hid repeated bullying.)

599
00:43:55,540 --> 00:43:57,581
(Education authorities dismissed Dong
and revoked his teaching license.)

600
00:43:57,582 --> 00:43:59,623
(Chaobei Vocational High was fined,
warned, and ordered to fix issues.)

601
00:43:59,624 --> 00:44:01,665
(Two document forgers were arrested
for providing fake IDs for profit.)

602
00:44:01,666 --> 00:44:03,707
(Each was sentenced to two years
and six months in prison.)

603
00:44:03,708 --> 00:44:05,749
(Su Lin committed extortion; Zhou's
neck injury was minor, not criminal.)

604
00:44:05,750 --> 00:44:07,791
(Su Lin later surrendered to police
and received a lighter sentence.)

605
00:44:07,792 --> 00:44:09,833
(Su Lin was sentenced to
18 months in prison.)

606
00:44:09,834 --> 00:44:11,875
(She showed remorse in prison
and had eight months cut from her term.)

607
00:44:11,876 --> 00:44:13,917
(After release, police restored
her household registration by law.)

608
00:44:13,918 --> 00:44:15,959
(Now Gu Lan, she sat that year's college
entrance exam with official support.)

609
00:44:15,960 --> 00:44:18,001
(She studied hard
throughout her prison term.)

610
00:44:18,002 --> 00:44:20,002
(Her score earned her admission
to the Foreign Languages College.)

611
00:44:22,976 --> 00:44:28,103
♪ Let the light in ♪

612
00:44:29,597 --> 00:44:35,158
♪ Set your heart free ♪

613
00:44:35,159 --> 00:44:40,066
♪ Become the sea ♪

614
00:45:23,088 --> 00:45:29,082
♪ Do you remember ♪

615
00:45:29,083 --> 00:45:33,936
♪ that perfect longing?♪

616
00:45:35,703 --> 00:45:38,962
♪ Thinking not being lonely ♪

617
00:45:38,963 --> 00:45:45,210
♪ Was love's reward ♪

618
00:45:51,590 --> 00:45:56,649
♪ But love ♪

619
00:45:56,650 --> 00:46:01,283
♪ Isn't a destination ♪

620
00:46:02,452 --> 00:46:08,224
♪ Open the wound ♪

621
00:46:08,225 --> 00:46:13,520
♪ Let the light in ♪

622
00:46:14,485 --> 00:46:20,046
♪ Set your heart free ♪

623
00:46:20,047 --> 00:46:24,954
♪ Become the sea ♪
